    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d634-a1">

                <pb facs="0749" n="[I]" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pgI"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Earl
                        Russell.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 22, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord:</hi> I have to enclose a copy of a portion
                    of a despatch addressed to the Secretary of State of the United States by James
                    R. Partridge, esq., minister resident to Salvador, with the accompanying papers.
                    It gives me pleasure to add that the course taken by Mr. Partridge has been
                    approved by my government.</p>
                <p>I pray your lordship to accept, <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c.</hi>,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Earl Russell,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
